    "detailed_description": "<h1>Major Updates</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891520/extras/5554107e513dee3475ee6bc933abb3f0.avif?t=1753261581\" width=616 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >v3.0 Frost Flower - Venture the Frost and Cure the Darkness with stronger Enchanted Cards! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891520/extras/efd1f48b8e74b5f3416ff28713a3f393.avif?t=1753261581\" width=616 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >v2.9 Fury Flower - Conquer the Firebrand and Furious Tasks for powerful Enchanted Cards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891520/extras/719e3d084f607163aef7fc898d790aa8.avif?t=1753261581\" width=616 height=98 /></span>v2.2 Halloween &amp; Winter\u00a0- Seasonal Sword Skins, Enchanted Cards, and the Cyan Forge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891520/extras/1ae97e60226079f66e7477e04acff146.avif?t=1753261581\" width=616 height=98 /></span>v2.0 Depth Challenger - Challenge a massive new area and collect more Enchanted Cards!</p></p><br><h1>Experience the Dungeon Early with the Free Demo!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891520/extras/659190fc0390bb7d5cbcce5f7695b04a.avif?t=1753261581\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Access to the first 3 Dungeon Areas</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Progress carries over</strong> to the Full Version so your grind is not for naught!<br></li><li> The Free Demo is <strong>an older version</strong>, so it may not fully reflect the Full Version</li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891520/extras/2b595779e11fca0d3d6808037d477861.avif?t=1753261581\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive deep into darkness, Discover Secrets, Fend off countless Enemies, Plunder and Escape with your Treasures, Buy, Collect, and Strengthen yourself with Enchanted Cards, Find the source of this darkness, and Quell the Deep Dark Wrath! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891520/extras/2e09f75becb7a425f79631325210bd35.poster.avif?t=1753261581\" width=614 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891520/extras/2e09f75becb7a425f79631325210bd35.webm?t=1753261581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891520/extras/2e09f75becb7a425f79631325210bd35.mp4?t=1753261581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891520/extras/93226b47d59992fb1f0efb15d2b1a5d1.avif?t=1753261581\" width=616 height=98 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a Handcrafted Dungeon filled with Unique Areas to get better at</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9(originally 5) Dungeon Areas</strong> to get used to and (not) get lost in </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Challenging enemies</strong> await the deeper areas of the Dungeon </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>The deeper you venture</strong>, the <strong>more Points</strong> you can Plunder and Gather </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Get better</strong> with your knowledge of the Dungeon or <strong>get outnumbered</strong> by the Wrath </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891520/extras/c47661f7395bb08a3af5fbb78cb20904.poster.avif?t=1753261581\" width=616 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891520/extras/c47661f7395bb08a3af5fbb78cb20904.webm?t=1753261581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891520/extras/c47661f7395bb08a3af5fbb78cb20904.mp4?t=1753261581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891520/extras/3e6eda1bb11cafc479e1aa60c6907215.avif?t=1753261581\" width=616 height=99 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enchanted Cards come with powerful Stat Boosts and Effects that can help you Dive Deep and Escape the Dungeon!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Available at the <strong>Card Shop</strong> or through <strong>various means in the Dungeon</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Mix and match</strong> them to your liking and give yourself the best chance at surviving the Dungeon </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > If you're lucky, applying <strong>Shiny ones</strong> can even give you extra Points </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891520/extras/07c8aa448c6dff04d671c771f8a115f1.poster.avif?t=1753261581\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891520/extras/07c8aa448c6dff04d671c771f8a115f1.webm?t=1753261581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891520/extras/07c8aa448c6dff04d671c771f8a115f1.mp4?t=1753261581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891520/extras/9d00ee7c2b27c7d92a4945a101f65e9c.avif?t=1753261581\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Are you up for a quick adventure? Or a big Oracle Piece excursion? The choice is yours!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Easy to learn</strong> mechanics, <strong>Hard-to-master</strong> Dungeon Layout </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Quick Access</strong> around the Safe Area's key locations using UI Controls </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Easy-to-access Backups</strong> and <strong>Cloud Saving</strong> to protect your progress </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Partial Controller Support</strong> and <strong>Configurable Inputs</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Fully offline</strong> so you can venture the Dungeon anytime, anywhere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Android version</strong> available via <strong>APK</strong> so you can play on-the-go</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891520/extras/28b587855edeee52589cf15580f53862.poster.avif?t=1753261581\" width=616 height=237 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891520/extras/28b587855edeee52589cf15580f53862.webm?t=1753261581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891520/extras/fd4cfd87373f9655bf4f006255783bc1.avif?t=1753261581\" width=616 height=212 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891520/extras/10020065d56885a05d4e619ea152709d.avif?t=1753261581\" width=616 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the latest updates about CraftedCircuitry's games, check out the Tumblr and YouTube links on the side!</p>",
