    "reviews": "\u201cDeep Dark Wrath is an engaging dungeon crawler with an intriguing story and solid combat. There are various skills and abilities to unlock, and the card system adds depth and complexity to the experience. Run-to-run gameplay can be a bit short, but aside from that, this is worth checking out\u201d<br>Softonic<br><br>\u201cThe game\u2019s unique blend of methodical planning and relentless action, paired with its striking visuals and atmospheric soundscape, creates an unforgettable experience that challenges both wit and reflexes.\u201d<br>Overage Gaming<br>",
